{
    "title": "Street View Map Navigation App",
    "description": "Explore Live earth map in HD and Navigate easy and fast Driving Directions of your desired routes with voice navigation & street view. You can find Satellite view of famous places with directions, real-time traffic and your desired places. \r\nGPS Navigation enables you to show the world new places, nearby places, real-time Traffic Locaters and live locations with addresses using Street View Map. My Location-Driving Direction is designed for all users with easy and simple user interface.\r\nMy Location & Nearby Places:\r\nStreet View Map Directions App enables you to get easily know your location and nearby places. Street View comes to find your current location details using \u201cWhere am I\u201d application using Driving Directions App.\r\nRoute Map-Driving Direction App:\r\nStreet View Map Directions App is a Navigation App for your routes and travel destinations. You can find an accurate location with Route Finder and quickly find the nearest public places. You can Navigate and explore places from around the world. Explore places from around the world with GPS Driving Route. \r\nRoute Finder and Map Directions:\r\nGPS route finder quickly gets your position on the map and gets your desired directions. Easy Rout Map-Navigation App is very helpful for tourists and trips with GPS map app road to find accurate & shortest way. Street View route finder helps you to find distance and traveling time and towards your desired location. \r\nLive Weather Details:\r\nWeather forecasts app provide the world\u2019s most accurate forecast and weather details like local rain trackers, weather maps & alerts.\r\nCountry Info:\r\nStreet View Map & Driving Direction App provides basic detail of almost all countries like population, capital, language, area, currency, borders, and call code.\r\nLeve Meter:\r\nA Lever meter indicates whether a surface is horizontal (level) or vertical (plumb). Street View Map Directions App is very helpful to check the level of any surface.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore Live earth map in HD and Navigate easy and fast Driving Directions of your desired routes with voice navigation &amp; street view. You can find Satellite view of famous places with directions, real-time traffic and your desired places. <br>GPS Navigation enables you to show the world new places, nearby places, real-time Traffic Locaters and live locations with addresses using Street View Map. My Location-Driving Direction is designed for all users with easy and simple user interface.<br>My Location &amp; Nearby Places:<br>Street View Map Directions App enables you to get easily know your location and nearby places. Street View comes to find your current location details using \u201cWhere am I\u201d application using Driving Directions App.<br>Route Map-Driving Direction App:<br>Street View Map Directions App is a Navigation App for your routes and travel destinations. You can find an accurate location with Route Finder and quickly find the nearest public places. You can Navigate and explore places from around the world. Explore places from around the world with GPS Driving Route. <br>Route Finder and Map Directions:<br>GPS route finder quickly gets your position on the map and gets your desired directions. Easy Rout Map-Navigation App is very helpful for tourists and trips with GPS map app road to find accurate &amp; shortest way. Street View route finder helps you to find distance and traveling time and towards your desired location. <br>Live Weather Details:<br>Weather forecasts app provide the world\u2019s most accurate forecast and weather details like local rain trackers, weather maps &amp; alerts.<br>Country Info:<br>Street View Map &amp; Driving Direction App provides basic detail of almost all countries like population, capital, language, area, currency, borders, and call code.<br>Leve Meter:<br>A Lever meter indicates whether a surface is horizontal (level) or vertical (plumb). Street View Map Directions App is very helpful to check the level of any surface.",
